    "title": "Exploring Coding Spot: Understanding Parametric Contributions to LLM Coding Performance",
    "citation": "Dongjun Kim et al., 2026",
    "url": "https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/1e9612ef689bb54c7e4f1b63460b291d2703608a",
    "authors": "Dongjun Kim; Minhyuk Kim; Yong-Chan Chun; Chanjun Park; Heu-Jeoung Lim",
